man - manual page reader
Executable: /bin/man.sh
Alias: man

USAGE
  man <topic>     show a manual
  man list        list topics
  man -k <word>   search all
                  manual pages

DESCRIPTION
  Opens /etc/man/<topic>.man in
  the 'less' pager. Unknown
  topics suggest similar names.

FILES
  /etc/man - manual pages

SEE ALSO
  less, programs
